  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">new methods agricult Ukr</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">nya jordbruksm Ukraina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till nya jordbruksmetoder i Ukraina. Insatsen syftar fr&#xE4;mst till att &#xF6;ka produktionskapaciteten hos jordbrukare i Cherston-omr&#xE5;det i s&#xF6;dra Ukraina. Insatsen kommer att vara koncentrerad kring 30 privata jordbruk och man &#xE4;mnar &#xF6;verf&#xF6;ra kunskap fr&#xE4;mst inom gr&#xF6;nsaksodling. Den upphandlade svenska parten &#xE4;r SwedeAgri.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to development of new agricultural methods in the Ukraine. The project aims at increasing the production capacity for farmers in the Cherston area in south Ukraine. The focus will be to support 30 private farms concerning principally vegetable plantation. The Swedish counterpart is SwedAgri.</narrative>
  </description>
